WEBVTT

00:06.220 --> 00:07.740
Now we're done.

00:08.610 --> 00:13.200
This barrier around the house will let us know
if there are any demons infiltrating the house.

00:13.200 --> 00:15.080
That's good to hear.

00:15.080 --> 00:20.290
If that noisy cat comes again,
I'll send her away.

00:20.880 --> 00:23.130
Don't get in my way!

00:27.170 --> 00:29.220
Just remembering her makes me angry!

00:29.220 --> 00:30.470
Calm down, Rys.

00:30.470 --> 00:35.560
You're too kind even after
getting attacked by her.

00:36.350 --> 00:39.590
It's not that I'm being kind or anything.

00:40.440 --> 00:42.150
I was just...

00:42.150 --> 00:45.110
Fenrys, didn't you know?!

00:45.110 --> 00:51.240
This man killed your brother,
Fengaryl, and his entire troop!

00:53.910 --> 00:56.120
What's wrong?

00:56.120 --> 00:58.160
It's nothing.

00:58.160 --> 00:59.120
Is that so?

01:02.110 --> 01:03.800
Let's go home.

01:04.390 --> 01:05.960
Y-Yeah.

01:18.730 --> 01:30.400
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

02:39.720 --> 02:41.430
#4: AN UNEXPECTED VISITOR

02:41.430 --> 02:44.390
#4: AN UNEXPECTED VISITOR
You're looking at your status again.

02:44.390 --> 02:46.830
Well, I was surprised.

02:51.030 --> 02:57.490
I still can't believe
that I have the 'Dragonslayer' title.

02:59.280 --> 03:03.290
This is the holy hoe
that cut the dragon's head off.

03:03.290 --> 03:08.040
S-Stop it!
You're making it sound really cool.

03:09.080 --> 03:11.120
Balirossa, where are you going?

03:11.830 --> 03:14.350
I'm going to hunt magic beasts for today.

03:19.950 --> 03:23.980
She goes out for training every day.
What a stoic person.

03:23.980 --> 03:27.690
I only got the title
thanks to Sir Flio, anyway.

03:27.690 --> 03:33.690
I need to be able to take out a C-Rank
magic beast by myself like her.

03:33.690 --> 03:36.450
I'll work hard, too.

03:39.790 --> 03:41.200
I...

03:41.200 --> 03:43.790
I want a title, too!

03:43.790 --> 03:51.040
The Dragonslayer title is so prestigious that
it even makes a commoner rise to be a noble!

03:51.040 --> 03:55.130
It's a coveted title for adventurers
who dream of rising to the top!

03:55.550 --> 04:00.600
Had I been faster,
I could get that title!

04:01.760 --> 04:04.680
I could restore my status as a noble,

04:04.680 --> 04:11.110
and have our family live in the castle,
like when my father was a knight.

04:14.190 --> 04:15.280
Excuse me.

04:17.240 --> 04:21.490
I heard that an old acquaintance of mine
lives in this area, so I came to visit.

04:21.490 --> 04:22.530
Do you happen to know?

04:22.530 --> 04:23.740
Who is he?

04:23.740 --> 04:27.160
In a forest full of magic beasts,
he's so lightly geared.

04:27.160 --> 04:29.370
Yes, I know.

04:29.760 --> 04:32.590
Are you acquainted with Sir Flio?

04:33.230 --> 04:36.010
Or perhaps, his wife?

04:36.010 --> 04:37.800
It is his wife.

04:38.110 --> 04:40.760
Ah, I see.

04:41.070 --> 04:43.930
Which means, you must be
someone from the Dark Army.

04:46.870 --> 04:50.560
She already cut ties with the Dark Army,
so what business do you have with her?

04:50.560 --> 04:54.330
Answer wisely, or you will have
to face this Balirossa.

04:55.440 --> 04:58.400
Indeed, I belong to the Dark Army.

04:58.400 --> 05:01.490
But I only came here today to see her.

05:03.820 --> 05:05.200
I'll leave straight away.

05:10.390 --> 05:13.960
Then, let's call it quits here.

05:13.960 --> 05:16.460
Please tell Fenrys this:

05:16.460 --> 05:20.130
"Next time let's have tea together
and talk about old times."

05:20.130 --> 05:21.680
Understood.

05:22.470 --> 05:25.450
My name is Balirossa.
May I know your name?

05:27.770 --> 05:29.230
Ghozal.

05:31.250 --> 05:34.530
Ghozal? What an odd name.

05:35.190 --> 05:37.190
Hey, Balirossa!

05:38.070 --> 05:40.490
Is everything okay?
Are you hurt?

05:40.490 --> 05:41.780
I'm fine.

05:41.780 --> 05:45.320
Just now a guy named Ghozal
from the Dark Army was here.

05:45.320 --> 05:46.610
Ghozal?

05:49.180 --> 05:54.420
If he's going to use a fake name,
he could've chosen a better one.

05:54.420 --> 05:55.540
A fake name?

05:55.540 --> 06:00.460
I came since there was a reaction
from my barrier, and I was in shock...

06:04.220 --> 06:07.890
...that you were talking with the Dark One,
as my status window detected.

06:07.890 --> 06:08.600
Eh?

06:11.060 --> 06:13.270
T-That's a joke, right?

06:13.270 --> 06:15.980
There's no merit to joke about that.

06:15.980 --> 06:20.280
He's indeed the Dark One.
His real name is Gholl.

06:20.280 --> 06:24.280
I-I pointed my sword at the Dark One...

06:25.070 --> 06:29.410
This is bad, he'll kill me for sure!

06:29.410 --> 06:31.290
THE NEXT DAY

06:31.290 --> 06:33.290
So you really came here.

06:33.750 --> 06:35.920
It's been a while, Fenrys.

06:35.920 --> 06:37.750
I'm Flio.

06:38.460 --> 06:40.880
May I call you Ghozal?

06:40.880 --> 06:41.710
Sure thing.

06:41.710 --> 06:44.010
Please, come in.

06:44.670 --> 06:48.680
To be able to keep calm in front of me...

06:49.430 --> 06:52.680
Lady Rys, I'm going to hang the laundry—

06:58.650 --> 06:59.820
Thank you...

07:00.780 --> 07:03.240
...for taking care of my subordinate
the other day.

07:04.740 --> 07:06.110
Why am I here?

07:06.110 --> 07:08.120
And next to him?!

07:09.330 --> 07:11.620
What business do you have
with us today?

07:12.120 --> 07:14.290
Are you here to avenge her defeat?

07:14.290 --> 07:15.500
Rys.

07:16.830 --> 07:19.460
My legs lose their strength!
I can't stand up!

07:19.460 --> 07:22.050
I don't like wasting time.

07:22.490 --> 07:25.050
Flio, would you like to join the Dark Army?

07:25.050 --> 07:27.050
What? Me?

07:29.970 --> 07:31.680
I decline your offer.

07:31.680 --> 07:34.770
You won't even accept
my personal invitation?

07:34.770 --> 07:39.610
But King Klyrode must be desperate
for that power of yours.

07:40.030 --> 07:43.570
Why do you hide in this place
and disobey the King?

07:43.570 --> 07:47.030
I think it's weird to think
that I have to fight on the human side

07:47.030 --> 07:48.950
just because I'm a human.

07:49.200 --> 07:52.580
And I'm not even from this world
to begin with.

07:52.580 --> 07:56.410
To be honest, I don't even know
the reason why you are fighting.

07:57.200 --> 07:59.330
Did no one explain it to you?

07:59.920 --> 08:02.500
My dear husband doesn't want to fight.

08:02.500 --> 08:05.170
So there's no need to explain to him.

08:05.170 --> 08:08.300
I see.
The reason for this war, huh?

08:09.430 --> 08:14.640
I guess no one truly knows
why we fight in the first place.

08:15.270 --> 08:19.350
This war has been going on
for five hundred years

08:19.810 --> 08:22.980
ever since the advent of
the first Dark One.

08:23.340 --> 08:24.980
Five hundred years?

08:24.980 --> 08:26.190
That's right.

08:26.190 --> 08:31.280
The first Dark One was an otherworlder
who came to conquer this world.

08:31.280 --> 08:32.580
He was an otherworlder?

08:33.080 --> 08:39.370
The demons that accepted the first Dark One
were oppressed by humans at that time.

08:39.370 --> 08:45.380
And then the war between the demons
and the humans who rejected him began.

08:45.380 --> 08:48.090
Were you even listening to me?

08:48.090 --> 08:50.680
Why do you speak about it so casually?

08:50.680 --> 08:54.470
The longer the war goes on, the more
grudges and resentments accumulate.

08:55.990 --> 08:58.680
This war won't end easily.

08:59.800 --> 09:03.560
Do you want to stop the war, Ghozal?

09:05.820 --> 09:10.280
There have been twelve generations
of Dark Ones, and so have our ideologies.

09:10.280 --> 09:14.790
Though I'm the current Dark One,
I have no desire to rule this world.

09:15.280 --> 09:16.830
However...

09:20.080 --> 09:22.080
I am the king of the demons.

09:22.500 --> 09:25.210
If there's a threat to my people,

09:25.210 --> 09:28.550
I won't stand by and let it fall
into human hands.

09:31.720 --> 09:36.390
Flio, I won't treat you bad.
Join my ranks.

09:36.860 --> 09:38.850
You're overestimating me.

09:38.850 --> 09:44.260
Besides, I'm not interested
in taking either side.

09:56.450 --> 09:58.080
What stubbornness.

09:58.080 --> 10:01.250
You must have turned down
the King's invitation like this too.

10:03.250 --> 10:06.750
I'm glad you understand, Ghozal.

10:07.750 --> 10:10.010
But I haven't given up yet.

10:10.670 --> 10:11.970
I'll be back.

10:12.720 --> 10:14.390
Aside from Flio,

10:14.390 --> 10:19.470
there's another human here who can
retain composure near the Dark One.

10:20.100 --> 10:21.680
She's a fascinating woman.

10:28.020 --> 10:30.640
You okay, Balirossa?

10:31.360 --> 10:34.660
Why did I end up like this...?

10:39.660 --> 10:43.620
I see. I lost consciousness yesterday.

10:45.120 --> 10:47.790
I've caused trouble for everyone.

10:47.790 --> 10:50.500
Everyone, I'm sorry about yesterday.

10:50.500 --> 10:52.630
Ba-Balirossa.

10:53.510 --> 10:54.510
Good morning.

10:55.380 --> 10:57.970
Heya, if it isn't Balirossa!

10:58.930 --> 11:01.680
I was just about to have breakfast.

11:02.140 --> 11:05.000
Fenrys's cooking is quite delicious.

11:05.000 --> 11:08.770
Go back home after you finish your food.

11:09.190 --> 11:11.530
My husband's answer won't change.

11:11.530 --> 11:16.610
Most of all, it's common sense to avoid
meal times when visiting someone's home.

11:16.610 --> 11:18.450
It's fine, Rys.

11:18.450 --> 11:20.120
What's the matter? Come here.

11:20.120 --> 11:22.790
B-But I'm dressed like this...

11:22.790 --> 11:25.040
Please excuse me!

11:26.830 --> 11:29.200
She does have a modest side too,
doesn't she?

11:42.510 --> 11:44.100
Hello there, Balirossa.

11:45.100 --> 11:47.310
I'd like to speak with you.

11:47.310 --> 11:50.900
I-I have to train my swordsmanship!

11:54.190 --> 11:56.990
Hey, Balirossa.

11:57.570 --> 12:00.370
I have to go to the river to do laundry!

12:13.300 --> 12:16.090
I have to go gather some firewood!

12:16.090 --> 12:18.510
Wow, she's quite a hard worker.

12:21.600 --> 12:25.600
That adventurer is being visited
by a certain demon?

12:25.600 --> 12:26.770
Yes.

12:26.770 --> 12:32.400
According to our intel, a suspicious man
who frequents the home of adventurer Flio

12:32.400 --> 12:36.490
has been seen flying to the demon territory.

12:37.280 --> 12:42.830
Are you telling me that he ignored
a summons from the King of this Kingdom

12:42.830 --> 12:46.080
and joined the Dark Army?!

12:46.080 --> 12:48.660
Fine, send the troops!

12:48.660 --> 12:50.580
Father, please don't be careless!

12:51.790 --> 12:56.880
If you send the troops while we're still
uncertain if he's with Dark Army or not,

12:57.340 --> 13:02.200
you might offend Sir Flio
and drive him to join the Dark Army.

13:02.200 --> 13:04.720
We should have a talk with him.

13:04.720 --> 13:06.020
A talk, you say?

13:06.020 --> 13:07.180
That's right.

13:07.180 --> 13:12.190
We should not only summon him
but also listen to what he wants.

13:12.690 --> 13:15.900
I believe it's important to compromise
rather than order.

13:15.900 --> 13:18.940
Shut your mouth, Princess!

13:19.650 --> 13:24.370
You can't run the country
with just ideals alone!

13:24.370 --> 13:25.490
But...!

13:25.490 --> 13:28.080
What are you waiting for?

13:28.080 --> 13:29.370
Sir Hero?

13:29.370 --> 13:33.460
Oh, you've come out of
the Southern Stronghold.

13:33.460 --> 13:36.000
Give me your troops.

13:36.000 --> 13:40.340
If he doesn't want to listen,
then I will make him obey me.

13:44.430 --> 13:47.810
O Dark One, where are you going?

13:47.810 --> 13:49.600
I'm going to visit him again.

13:49.600 --> 13:52.690
It's dangerous to keep going
to visit him alone

13:52.690 --> 13:54.310
Dangerous?

13:54.310 --> 14:00.070
He's far more understanding
than a certain king.

14:00.480 --> 14:04.240
If I could win him over,
it would be better to keep doing this.

14:04.240 --> 14:10.040
That being said, everyone is
waiting for your instructions.

14:10.440 --> 14:13.300
I already have some thoughts about
the timing of our attack.

14:15.670 --> 14:21.760
Some have started to badmouth you
because you're visiting that man.

14:22.190 --> 14:28.470
Lord Gholl, you're only trying
to win him over, right?

14:32.840 --> 14:35.980
Dear, what are you doing?

14:35.980 --> 14:42.320
I'm thinking of selling prototype gears
I made from dragon scales in town.

14:42.320 --> 14:45.530
Well, isn't that a wonderful product!

14:45.530 --> 14:49.120
I need to make more prototypes
before I can sell it as a product.

14:49.720 --> 14:53.650
I want to make this business a success
for the sake of our livelihood.

14:58.590 --> 15:02.130
So, Dear, are you sure about that?

15:02.130 --> 15:03.300
About what?

15:03.300 --> 15:06.890
If you had worked for the Hero
as the kingdom ordered,

15:06.890 --> 15:11.390
you would get a reward
incomparable to what you have now.

15:12.600 --> 15:17.350
You could have used
your strength to the fullest.

15:18.770 --> 15:24.360
Could it be that you chose not to fight
the Dark Army for my sake?

15:24.360 --> 15:26.360
That's not it.

15:26.360 --> 15:27.910
Really?

15:27.910 --> 15:32.370
You're so kind, so I thought
you were being considerate.

15:32.370 --> 15:38.040
I'm not as kind as you think.
It's just...

15:39.520 --> 15:42.610
Now that I know I have
tremendous power,

15:43.320 --> 15:46.470
if it's possible, I don't want
to fight with anyone.

15:48.220 --> 15:50.710
That's what is called kindness.

15:51.430 --> 15:55.940
I really admire that part of you.

15:58.560 --> 15:59.710
Rys...

16:02.270 --> 16:04.480
I'm sure it's Ghozal again.

16:04.480 --> 16:06.950
But the barriers didn't react.

16:06.950 --> 16:10.410
Sir Flio!

16:12.620 --> 16:15.040
Are you Flio the adventurer?

16:15.040 --> 16:16.080
Yes.

16:16.080 --> 16:19.420
I know all about your move.

16:20.420 --> 16:23.210
Dear, would you like me
to drive them away?

16:23.210 --> 16:25.090
No, it's fine.

16:25.450 --> 16:28.470
You were dealing with
the Dark Army, am I right?

16:28.470 --> 16:30.050
I will give you choices.

16:30.050 --> 16:34.680
Become my subordinate and assist me
in subjugating the Dark One.

16:34.680 --> 16:36.680
Or...!

16:40.480 --> 16:44.980
Be slayed by me as an accomplice
to the Dark Army.

16:49.070 --> 16:50.360
Nailed it.

16:50.360 --> 16:55.990
That was one of the three best climax scenes
of my life, the famous cavalry front.

16:56.560 --> 16:59.960
Are you so overwhelmed by my aura
that you can't even speak?

17:00.790 --> 17:02.710
It can't be helped.

17:02.710 --> 17:07.880
Soon I will be a true hero
and become a legend in this world.

17:07.880 --> 17:12.970
After I get this man under my command
to defeat the Dark One.

17:12.970 --> 17:16.770
I'm in a dilemma.
I don't want to choose either one.

17:17.560 --> 17:22.190
So many of you even have come here.
My apologies.

17:22.530 --> 17:26.650
I have no intention of joining
either you or the Dark Army.

17:29.820 --> 17:34.120
So you choose death as a traitor
who betrayed his country?

17:34.120 --> 17:35.780
That's not what I meant.

17:35.780 --> 17:37.620
That is rude, Sir Hero!

17:37.620 --> 17:41.500
She's right!
Listen to other people, will you?

17:41.500 --> 17:45.420
Sir Flio is not a traitor.

17:46.580 --> 17:51.840
I heard people are working with him,
so it was all of you.

17:53.470 --> 17:56.930
I can arrest you all for treason,

17:56.930 --> 18:02.910
but I'll let you off the hook
if you help me convince him.

18:07.670 --> 18:09.190
No other options, huh?

18:09.570 --> 18:13.570
I can't afford to get
Balirossa and others in trouble.

18:13.570 --> 18:16.690
What will you do, Dear?

18:19.700 --> 18:23.370
I won't choose sides,
and I'm not going to fight.

18:23.370 --> 18:25.540
Let's go somewhere else.

18:25.540 --> 18:27.590
Is that okay with you, Rys?

18:27.590 --> 18:31.130
Yes! I'll go with you, Dear.

18:32.640 --> 18:35.930
Please allow us to join you, Sir Flio.

18:35.930 --> 18:38.100
But weren't you girls...

18:38.100 --> 18:43.520
We were taught from an early age
that demons must be defeated.

18:43.520 --> 18:44.390
However,

18:45.000 --> 18:49.980
as we spent time with you and Lady Rys,
we began to have questions.

18:50.440 --> 18:54.400
We wonder if it's really right
to fight against them.

18:56.110 --> 19:03.830
And I can't face my father if I follow those
who turn its force upon innocent people!

19:04.220 --> 19:06.040
It's as Balirossa said.

19:06.040 --> 19:08.500
Please allow us to go with you.

19:08.500 --> 19:10.000
I beg you.

19:10.000 --> 19:11.380
What are you talking about?

19:11.380 --> 19:14.090
You think you can escape
from this siege?

19:14.090 --> 19:15.050
Got it.

19:15.050 --> 19:15.970
Huh?!

19:15.970 --> 19:18.550
Know your place!

19:18.900 --> 19:20.270
Teleportation!

19:24.230 --> 19:25.940
You've got to be kidding me!

19:25.940 --> 19:32.820
How dare you use magic
that I can't use!

19:40.080 --> 19:41.870
They're gone.

19:41.870 --> 19:43.410
Even the house and fields...

19:43.410 --> 19:47.040
No way he can use such
a wide range of teleportation magic!

19:48.380 --> 19:49.750
Sir Hero!

19:50.160 --> 19:51.040
What now?

19:51.040 --> 19:54.930
That's the demon who has been in touch
with Flio the adventurer.

19:55.420 --> 19:56.630
What did you say?!

19:57.090 --> 19:58.550
C-Catch him!

19:58.550 --> 20:00.100
The house...

20:01.050 --> 20:05.390
I see. So this is all your doings.

20:15.990 --> 20:19.700
Then you have to pay
for what you've done!

20:21.660 --> 20:23.540
Hear me, Dark Army!

20:23.540 --> 20:28.170
Assemble and attack
the Magical Kingdom of Klyrode!

20:28.790 --> 20:32.500
Show them all what demons are made of!

20:33.130 --> 20:34.210
Yes, My Lord!

20:34.210 --> 20:37.050
You heard the Dark One, everyone!

20:37.340 --> 20:39.130
He's ordering us to attack!

20:39.130 --> 20:42.140
Don't be slow!

20:43.720 --> 20:44.970
What's that?

20:44.970 --> 20:47.020
Y-You must be kidding me!

20:47.020 --> 20:49.480
Retreat!

20:49.480 --> 20:51.560
W-Wait!

21:01.870 --> 21:03.120
This is amazing!

21:07.200 --> 21:09.790
The house and the fields
are still intact.

21:10.150 --> 21:11.250
Where is this place?

21:11.250 --> 21:14.540
This is near a town called Houghtow,
the west of the royal capital.

21:15.090 --> 21:18.630
I came here not too long ago
to sell some dragon materials.

21:19.880 --> 21:23.180
We're a long way from
the royal capital, aren't we?

21:23.720 --> 21:28.270
This place should be safe not only from
the Hero but from the Dark One as well.

21:30.100 --> 21:32.400
Thank goodness.

21:32.400 --> 21:33.940
Good for you.

21:33.940 --> 21:36.230
Since he likes you so much.

21:36.630 --> 21:40.110
I'm sorry to make you
go through all that.

21:40.650 --> 21:43.110
It's not your fault, Dear.

21:43.110 --> 21:50.250
If it means to be always with you,
I'll go anywhere.

21:50.250 --> 21:51.540
Thank you.

21:51.540 --> 21:54.170
I'm your wife after all.

21:54.170 --> 21:56.500
Now let's have dinner!

21:56.870 --> 22:00.090
I'm going to cook a feast today
to celebrate our move.

22:00.090 --> 22:02.510
I'm looking forward to it.

22:02.510 --> 22:04.050
I'll help too.

22:04.050 --> 22:06.510
I'm so hungry.

22:06.510 --> 22:08.010
Me too.

23:40.610 --> 23:43.050
I want a title, too!

23:43.050 --> 23:44.360
You're bringing it out again.

23:44.360 --> 23:46.650
You might get a title too, you know?

23:46.650 --> 23:47.230
Huh?

23:47.230 --> 23:48.240
The Dark One's Killer.

23:48.240 --> 23:50.080
It's something like the "Uncle Killer."

23:50.080 --> 23:52.430
You've captivated the Dark One,
so it's Dark One's Killer.

23:52.430 --> 23:53.950
You're the best, Balirossa!

23:53.950 --> 23:55.290
Stop it!

23:55.290 --> 23:56.790
Next episode: "Until the End of My Life."

23:56.790 --> 23:57.540
NEXT: UNTIL THE END OF MY LIFE
